{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TjSyFn4VMR1795404020.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國達美航空出現系統故障，導致逾千班進出亞特蘭大國際機場的航班延誤。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.DELTA-0930.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wb3KkgwOqY1795398604.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>達美發聲明表示，航班延誤是由於重量與平衡自動化系統故障。公司轉以人工方式安排航班起飛，同時繼續努力修復自動化系統。根據航班追蹤網站數據，截至當地星期日下午近6時，有逾1,100班進出亞特蘭大國際機場的航班延誤，其中達美航空佔1,005班。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.DELTA-0930_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026l3YurLbBzm1795398596.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>聯邦航空管理局表示，達美航班延誤不涉及該局的航空交通系統。美國航空交通管理系統本月13日出問題，連續多天引發混亂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:28:59.705967+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T01:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:25.566202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:25.566202+00:00","content_hash":"af4dd9db2cd65feab14a9b6300ba4b94aeac66599d4e93c7ad41761854e49cc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}